# Vectors of tests/data/sst68040_fpuh (three steps each: an FPU instruction,
# an FNOP, and FSAVE as the first word of every FPU exception handler) on
# which the fork does not match the oracle. See tests/SstKnown.h for the
# rules: a listed vector that passes, or is missing, fails the gate.

# None at present. The twelve vectors listed here on 2026-11-07 (a dyadic
# instruction with a packed-decimal source) were not a divergence of the
# fork: the oracle built their state frame from an uninitialised operand,
# and they pass since oracle patch 13 (oracle/uae/VENDOR.md).
